## R3
Primary P2 basket: XAUUSD.DWX, EURUSD.DWX, GBPUSD.DWX, GER40.DWX, NDX.DWX.

If this is later tested primarily on SP500.DWX, live promotion T6 gate: SP500.DWX is not broker-routable. If the EA passes P0-P9 on SP500.DWX only, T6 deploy requires a parallel-validation on NDX.DWX or WS30.DWX before AutoTrading enable.

## Author Claims
- Source says this is a short-term XAUUSD M15 liquidity sweep / TS pattern.
- Source says bullish setups sweep the previous low, close bullish, and close back above the previous low.
- Source says positions close automatically by stop loss or RR take profit.

## Parameters To Test
- Timeframe: M5, M15, M30.
- EMA filter: off, EMA(200) on.
- RR target: 1.0R, 1.5R, 2.0R.
- Stop buffer: 0, 2, 5, 10 ticks.
- Session: full day, London, New York, London+New York.
- Sweep candle ATR bounds: none, 0.25-2.5 ATR, 0.5-2.0 ATR.

## Initial Risk Profile
High-cadence sweep reversal model. Main risks are spread sensitivity on one-candle stops and repeated false reversals in strong directional sessions.

